`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:[e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Matched budget."})," Compare at the same training-token, compute or wall-clock budget, and include the challenger's overhead. AlgoPerf fixes such a common budget ",e.jsx(a,{id:"dahl2023algoperf",children:"Dahl et al., 2023"}),"."]}),`
`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:[e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Tuning."})," Give AdamW and the challenger comparable search effort and the same rule for picking checkpoints. The recurring failure mode is unfair baselines: a new optimizer, tuned hard, is compared against an untuned AdamW baseline, and under matched tuning the claimed speedup often shrinks or vanishes. Schmidt et al. benchmarked fifteen optimizers on eight deep-learning problems, in over 50,000 runs. None consistently beat a well-tuned Adam ",e.jsx(a,{id:"schmidt2021valley",children:"Schmidt et al., 2021"}),"."]}),`
